@startuml "Déconnexion - Diagramme de séquence"

title Processus de déconnexion utilisateur

actor "Utilisateur" as User
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Controller" as AuthCtrl
participant "Auth Service" as AuthSvc
participant "User Service" as UserSvc
participant "Redis Cache" as Redis
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

== Déconnexion ==
User -> Frontend: Se déconnecter
activate Frontend
Frontend -> API: POST /api/auth/logout
note right: Header: Authorization: Bearer {token}
activate API

API -> AuthCtrl: logout(token)
activate AuthCtrl

AuthCtrl -> AuthSvc: validateJWT(token)
activate AuthSvc
AuthSvc -> AuthSvc: jwt.verify(token, secret)
AuthSvc --> AuthCtrl: decoded payload
deactivate AuthSvc

alt Token valide
    AuthCtrl -> UserSvc: deleteSession(userId, token)
    activate UserSvc
    UserSvc -> DB: DELETE FROM user_sessions WHERE userId=? AND token=?
    activate DB
    DB --> UserSvc: session deleted
    deactivate DB
    deactivate UserSvc
    
    AuthCtrl -> Redis: DEL refresh:{refreshToken}
    activate Redis
    Redis --> AuthCtrl: refresh token removed
    deactivate Redis
    
    AuthCtrl --> API: logout success
    deactivate AuthCtrl
    API --> Frontend: logout successful
    deactivate API
    Frontend -> Frontend: Supprimer tokens locaux (cookies/storage)
    Frontend -> Frontend: Rediriger vers page d'accueil
    Frontend --> User: "Déconnecté avec succès"
    deactivate Frontend
    
else Token invalide
    note right of AuthCtrl: Même en cas de token invalide,\nla déconnexion côté client est effectuée
    AuthCtrl --> API: logout success
    deactivate AuthCtrl
    API --> Frontend: logout successful
    deactivate API
    Frontend -> Frontend: Supprimer tokens locaux
    Frontend -> Frontend: Rediriger vers page d'accueil
    Frontend --> User: "Déconnecté"
    deactivate Frontend
end

note over User, DB
    La déconnexion supprime la session active 
    et invalide le refresh token pour sécurité
end note

@enduml